    <string name="notes_about_title">About</string>
    <string name="notes_about_body">Kitty Notes is a sweet little notebook for your everyday thoughts.

• Write and organize notes with categories and tags
• Pin important notes and find them fast with search
• See your notes on a calendar by last-edited date
• Start quickly with templates and Quick Note
• Keep little reminders as Sticky Notes
• Archive old notes or restore them from Trash
• Personalize theme colors and dark mode
• Protect your notes with a password lock
• Back up and restore your notes from a file</string>
